 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Rockstar — Innate Technique (1st level)</em></p><blockquote><p>You can amplify sound and launch it as a blast of energy.</p></blockquote><p>Starting at 1st level, you gain proficiency in Performance and one instrument of your choice. While holding an instrument you are proficient in, you can spend 1 CE as an action to play it and launch a Sound Blast at a target within 30 feet. Make a ranged Cursed Energy attack roll, on a hit you deal 2d10 thunder damage and if the target is a creature, it must succeed on a Strength saving throw or be pushed back 10 feet. This technique's damage increases to 3d10 at 6th level, 4d10 at 11th level, and 6d10 at 18th level.</p>",
